<title>USA: Metal Recovery Q3 loss smaller.</title>
<headline>Metal Recovery Q3 loss smaller.</headline>
<dateline>EAST CHICAGO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zinc recycler Metal Recovery Technologies Inc reported a non-capitalized loss of $90,771 or $0.006 per share for the third quarter ended September 30.</p>
<p>Metal Recovery said in a statement the loss compared to a loss of $34.9 million for the same period last year.</p>
<p>The report is the first since it began operating the East Chicago facility, it said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
